ent-WFEnvSac = flesh sac
    .desc = A wet sac stuck to the deck. It swells and sinks like it is breathing.
ent-WFEnvSacBig = flesh sac
    .desc = A fat, wet sac stuck to the deck. It swells and sinks like it is breathing.
ent-WFEnvSacSmall = small flesh sac
    .desc = A fist-sized sac stuck to the deck. It twitches.
ent-WFEnvSacBeating = beating sac
    .desc = A fat sac with a slow heartbeat in it. Stand close and you can hear it.
ent-WFEnvOrgans = heap of organs
    .desc = Wet organs heaped on the deck and growing into it. Some of them are still working.
ent-WFEnvOrgansB = heap of organs
    .desc = Wet organs heaped on the deck and growing into it. Some of them are still working.
ent-WFEnvOrgansC = heap of organs
    .desc = Wet organs heaped on the deck and growing into it. Some of them are still working.
ent-WFEnvSpur = bone spurs
    .desc = Pale spikes of bone pushing up through the flesh.
ent-WFEnvSpurTall = bone spurs
    .desc = Pale spikes of bone pushing up through the flesh.
ent-WFEnvSpurLow = bone spurs
    .desc = Pale spikes of bone pushing up through the flesh.
ent-WFEnvTendril = tendrils
    .desc = Thin roots of grey flesh crawling across the deck.
ent-WFEnvTendrilB = tendrils
    .desc = Thin roots of grey flesh crawling across the deck.
ent-WFEnvTendrilC = tendrils
    .desc = Thin roots of grey flesh crawling across the deck.
ent-WFEnvGore = gore
    .desc = A lot of someone, spread thin.
ent-WFEnvGoreSmear = gore
    .desc = Dragged across the floor and left to dry.
ent-WFEnvGoreSpray = gore
    .desc = Sprayed up the wall and run down.
ent-WFEnvGoreScraps = gore
    .desc = Scraps of someone. It is hard to say which part.
ent-WFEnvGoreTrail = gore
    .desc = A wet trail of gore.
ent-WFEnvRemains = remains
    .desc = Picked clean. Whatever did it was thorough.
ent-WFEnvOoze = ooze
    .desc = Sour green slime. It smells like a rotten fridge.
ent-WFEnvDrip = dripping ooze
    .desc = Something wet keeps falling from above, one slow drop at a time.
ent-WFEnvWeb = veins
    .desc = Thin red veins grown across it. They throb.
ent-WFEnvWebB = veins
    .desc = Thin red veins grown across it. They throb.
ent-WFEnvWebC = veins
    .desc = Thin red veins grown across it. They throb.
ent-WFEnvScreen = corrupted screen
    .desc = The screen is full of strange writing. It flickers when you look at it.
ent-WFEnvScreenB = corrupted screen
    .desc = The screen is full of strange writing. It flickers when you look at it.
ent-WFEnvHaze = sour mist
    .desc = A thin haze that smells of copper and rot.
ent-WFEnvHazeB = sour mist
    .desc = A thin haze that smells of copper and rot.
ent-WFEnvCocoon = fused remains
    .desc = Someone's body, grown into the wall. You would rather not look for a face.
ent-WFEnvCocoonB = fused remains
    .desc = Someone's body, grown into the wall. You would rather not look for a face.

wf-remade-morgue-knock = Something knocks from inside the {$tray}.
wf-remade-morgue-burst = The {$tray} bursts open!
wf-remade-closet-torn = Something tears the {$locker} open!
wf-remade-vent-burst = Something tears out of the vent!
wf-remade-vent-tell = The vent rattles. Something is in it.
wf-remade-guard-cry = The Monolith screams. Everything near it turns.
